  cookingInstructions:
  - Slice the pork belly
  - Slice the pork liver
  - Slice the kikiam
  - Slice the onion
  - Slice the garlic
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Put the pan on the stove
  - Add 1/4 cup of cooking oil
  - Add the onion
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the pork
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the kikiam
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the chicken liver
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add pork bouillon
  - ' Add water'
  - Add 1/6 cup of soy sauce
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Cover it with pan lid cook until simmering
  - Add lomi noodles
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - Add dissolved cassava
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - Add eggs beaten
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Turn the heat into meadium
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - Add 1/6 tbsp of salt
  - Add 1/6 tbsp of pepper
